<title>USA: Brunswick Corp Q4 net climbs.</title>
<headline>Brunswick Corp Q4 net climbs.</headline>
<dateline>LAKE FOREST, Ill. 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			   1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.29		    $0.23</p>
<p> Net			 29,100		   22,200</p>
<p> Revs		     799,500		  665,500</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  99,200		   96,800</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.88		    $1.32</p>
<p> Net			185,800		  127,200</p>
<p> Revs		   3,160,300		2,906,300</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  98,800		   96,200</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Fiscal 1995 earnings included a non-recurring charge of $260,000, as well as a loss of $70,000 on disposition of company's Technical segment.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
